---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Resources for Iowa Educators Supporting Military Children
description: Find Purple Star School guidance, Month of the Military Child classroom kits, and resources for Iowa educators supporting military-connected students.
permalink: /educators/index.html
mainClass: educators-page
---
{% macro cardHeading(title, icon) %}
  <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
    <span class="grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-primary">
      <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path d="{{ icon }}"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-900">{{ title }}</h2>
  </div>
{% endmacro %}

{% macro resourceLink(url, label, thumbnail) %}
  <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-3 rounded-sm py-2 font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-slate-900 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary" href="{{ url | escape }}">
    {% if thumbnail %}
      <img src="{{ thumbnail }}" alt="" width="40" height="40" class="h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white object-contain" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    {% endif %}
    <span>{{ label }}</span>
  </a>
{% endmacro %}

{% set cardClass = "min-w-0 space-y-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-zinc-50 p-5 sm:p-7" %}
{% set summaryClass = "min-h-11 cursor-pointer rounded-sm py-3 font-semibold text-primary hover:underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary" %}

<section class="border-b border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="container grid items-center gap-6 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_14rem] lg:gap-10">
    <div class="min-w-0 space-y-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-primary">IOWA CYP · EDUCATOR RESOURCES</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Supporting Iowa's Military-Connected Students</h1>
      <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Everything schools need to take meaningful steps toward supporting military children and pursuing Purple Star School recognition.</p>
      <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2" role="list">
        {% for label in ["Designation Guidance", "School Resources", "Family Support"] %}
          <li class="rounded-full border border-stone-200 bg-stone-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">{{ label }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <img src="/assets/img/resources/teaching.jpg" alt="Educators collaborating on classroom plans" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full max-w-56 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 object-cover" {{ imageAttrs('/assets/img/resources/teaching.jpg') }} decoding="async">
  </div>
</section>

<div class="bg-white py-8 sm:py-12">
  <div class="container grid items-start gap-5 leading-relaxed text-slate-700 md:grid-cols-2">
    <article class="{{ cardClass }}">
      {{ cardHeading("Purple Star Requirements", "m12 3 2.8 5.7 6.2.9-4.5 4.4 1.1 6.2-5.6-3-5.6 3 1.1-6.2L3 9.6l6.2-.9L12 3Z") }}
      <p>Review what the Iowa Department of Education requires and plan how your school will support military-connected students.</p>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Official Iowa designation requirements</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
        <li>Name a staff member as the military liaison for students and families.</li>
        <li>Keep a dedicated public webpage with resources for military-connected families.</li>
        <li>Run programs or events that build awareness and support military-connected students.</li>
        <li>Offer staff training on the challenges these students face.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Designation lasts three years. Check the state guidance for application dates, sample questions, and renewal information.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>{{ resourceLink("https://educate.iowa.gov/pk-12/award-exchange-programs/purple-star-school-program", "Iowa Department of Education guidance") }}</li>
        <li>{{ resourceLink("mailto:purple.star@iowa.gov", "Email the state designation team") }}</li>
      </ul>
      <details class="border-t border-slate-200">
        <summary class="{{ summaryClass }}">Iowa CYP suggestions for preparing</summary>
        <p class="pb-2">Start with a liaison and a small planning team. Review what your school already offers, draft your family resource page, and pick an awareness activity and staff training topic. Keep examples of this work on hand when you apply.</p>
      </details>
    </article>

    <article class="{{ cardClass }}">
      {{ cardHeading("Build Your School Webpage", "M4 4h16a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v14a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1Zm-1 5h18m-14 4h4m-4 3h9") }}
      <p>Give military families one place to find their school liaison, get help enrolling, and connect with local support. Link to it from a spot families already use, such as your district’s enrollment or family resources menu.</p>
      <details class="border-t border-slate-200">
        <summary class="{{ summaryClass }}">Military Family Webpage Starter Kit</summary>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pb-2 pl-5">
          <li><strong>Welcome.</strong> Introduce your school and tell newly arriving families where to start.</li>
          <li><strong>Military liaison.</strong> List the liaison’s name, role, and school contact information.</li>
          <li><strong>Enrollment and transitions.</strong> Link to registration, records transfer, and help with course placement.</li>
          <li><strong>School contacts.</strong> Point families to the registrar, counselors, and student support staff.</li>
          <li><strong>Military family resources.</strong> Include education and transition resources alongside Iowa CYP programs.</li>
          <li><strong>Local support.</strong> List nearby military family services and how to contact them.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="pb-2">Ask your liaison to review the page each school year and confirm contacts and links are current.</p>
      </details>
    </article>

    <article class="{{ cardClass }}">
      {{ cardHeading("Classroom Activities & Kits", "M3 5h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v11a5 5 0 0 0-4-2H3V5Zm18 0h-5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v11a5 5 0 0 1 4-2h5V5Z") }}
      <p>Recognize military-connected students each April. Host a Purple Up day, make a hallway display, or invite military families to share their experiences if they choose.</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <img src="/content/Media/ball2.jpg" alt="Families dancing together at the Military Family Ball" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 object-cover" {{ imageAttrs('/content/Media/ball2.jpg') }} loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        <img src="/assets/img/programs/family_ball_dance.jpg" alt="Guard families on the dance floor at the Military Family Ball" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 object-cover" {{ imageAttrs('/assets/img/programs/family_ball_dance.jpg') }} loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li>{{ resourceLink("/month-of-the-military-child/", "Month of the Military Child activities, classroom kits, and family events") }}</li>
        <li>{{ resourceLink("mailto:iaarngcyp@gmail.com?subject=Purple%20Up%20Highlights", "Email your Purple Up highlights") }}</li>
      </ul>
      <details class="border-t border-slate-200">
        <summary class="{{ summaryClass }}">Flyers and classroom resources</summary>
        <ul>
          <li>{{ resourceLink("/assets/files/momc_flyer.png", "Ways to Participate flyer") }}</li>
          <li>{{ resourceLink("/assets/files/purpleup.jpg", "Purple Up profile graphic") }}</li>
          <li>{{ resourceLink("/assets/files/momc_overview.png", "Month of the Military Child overview flyer") }}</li>
          <li>{{ resourceLink("/lemonade-boss/", "Lemonade Boss youth entrepreneurship curriculum", "/assets/img/lemonade-banner.jpg") }}</li>
        </ul>
      </details>
    </article>

    <article class="{{ cardClass }}">
      {{ cardHeading("Staff Training Resources", "M3 8l9-5 9 5-9 5-9-5Zm4 2.2V16c3 2 7 2 10 0v-5.8M21 8v7") }}
      <p>Help teachers, counselors, administrators, and enrollment staff recognize how moves, deployment, and caregiver absences can affect students.</p>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Topics for staff development</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
        <li>How the military lifestyle can shape a student’s experience at school.</li>
        <li>How staff can help with midyear enrollment, records transfers, course placement, and belonging.</li>
        <li>How to connect students and families with the school liaison and local supports.</li>
      </ul>
      {{ resourceLink("https://militarychild.org/for-education-professionals/training/", "Military Child Education Coalition training for educators") }}
    </article>

    <article class="{{ cardClass }}">
      {{ cardHeading("Military Family Support", "M20.8 8.7c0 4-4.5 7.3-8.8 11.3C7.7 16 3.2 12.7 3.2 8.7A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 12 7.4a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 8.8 1.3Z") }}
      <p>Share Iowa CYP programs with families first, then connect them with help for school moves, tutoring, and enrichment.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>{{ resourceLink("/military-families/", "Iowa military family programs and support contacts") }}</li>
        <li>{{ resourceLink("/resources/", "Iowa CYP family resource directory") }}</li>
      </ul>
      <details class="border-t border-slate-200">
        <summary class="{{ summaryClass }}">School transitions, tutoring, and enrichment</summary>
        <ul>
          <li>{{ resourceLink("https://mic3.net/state/iowa/", "Iowa Interstate Compact on Educational Opportunity for Military Children") }}</li>
          <li>{{ resourceLink("https://military.tutor.com/home", "Tutor.com for military families", "/content/Media/tutor-square-color.png") }}</li>
          <li>{{ resourceLink("https://www.bgca.org/about-us/military/mission-youth-outreach-2025/", "Boys & Girls Clubs Mission Youth Outreach", "/assets/img/partners/partner_bgca.png") }}</li>
          <li>{{ resourceLink(site.links.scholarshipDatabase, "Scholarship database for military-connected students", "/assets/img/resources/resource_scholarships.svg") }}</li>
          <li>{{ resourceLink("https://search.militaryscholar.org/", "Search national scholarships for military families") }}</li>
        </ul>
      </details>
    </article>

    <article class="{{ cardClass }}">
      {{ cardHeading("Contact Iowa CYP", "M5 5h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Zm-2 2 9 6 9-6") }}
      <p>Ask Iowa CYP for a school briefing or a planning conversation. We can help you find resources, develop your military family webpage, plan a classroom activity, or identify ways for your school and Iowa CYP to work together.</p>
      <p>We can also share sample talking points and help connect you with Soldier and Family Readiness Support Specialists or designated peer schools.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>{{ resourceLink("/contact/#general-contact", "View Iowa CYP contact information") }}</li>
        <li>{{ resourceLink("mailto:" + site.contactEmail, "Email Iowa CYP") }}</li>
        <li>{{ resourceLink("tel:" + (site.contactPhone | replace("-", "")), "Call Iowa CYP at " + site.contactPhone) }}</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>
